{:rec/vertical [:vertical/id :vertical/isic-6120] :rec/unit "custom annual contract / sales-assisted (no self-serve band)" :rec/rationale "No self-serve band exists to anchor to — the only pattern this market has validated." :rec/run-id "pricing-intel-20260716-01" :rec/at "2026-07-16" :rec/seq 111}
