{:obs/vertical [:vertical/id :vertical/isic-7810] :obs/product [:product/id :product/jobadder] :obs/price-summary "No public pricing; sales-gated custom quote across 4 tiers (Recruiter Lite/Essential/Pro/Business); third-party benchmarks estimate Lite ~$99/user/mo, Essential ~$139-160/user/mo, Pro sales-only" :obs/disclosure-tier :tier/estimated :obs/source-url "https://avahr.com/jobadder-pricing/" :obs/run-id "pricing-intel-20260716-03" :obs/at "2026-07-16" :obs/seq 127}
{:obs/vertical [:vertical/id :vertical/isic-7810] :obs/product [:product/id :product/zoho-recruit-staffing] :obs/price-summary "Staffing Agency edition: Standard $25/recruiter/mo (100 jobs), Professional $50/recruiter/mo (250 jobs, adds AI candidate matching/SMS), Enterprise $75/recruiter/mo (750 jobs); billed annually, ~20% more month-to-month; free tier capped at 1 active job" :obs/disclosure-tier :tier/published :obs/source-url "https://www.zoho.com/recruit/staffing-agency-software.html" :obs/run-id "pricing-intel-20260716-03" :obs/at "2026-07-16" :obs/seq 128}
{:obs/vertical [:vertical/id :vertical/isic-7810] :obs/product [:product/id :product/bullhorn] :obs/price-summary "No public pricing; sales-gated custom quote, no free trial; third-party benchmarks estimate Starter $99/user/mo (1-2 users), Core $165/user/mo, Pro custom; annual contracts commonly start near $20k/yr for small teams once implementation fees ($1k-50k+) and ~20% renewal increases are included" :obs/disclosure-tier :tier/estimated :obs/source-url "https://www.pin.com/blog/bullhorn-pricing/" :obs/run-id "pricing-intel-20260716-03" :obs/at "2026-07-16" :obs/seq 129}
{:rec/vertical [:vertical/id :vertical/isic-7810] :rec/band-low 60000.0 :rec/band-high 150000.0 :rec/unit "¥/agency/月 (flat, unlimited seats)" :rec/rationale "All 4 surveyed competitors price per-recruiter-seat ($25-315/user/mo), so cost scales with headcount; a typical 3-5-staff community agency's real spend lands ~¥22k-90k/月 (Zoho Professional) up to ~¥74k-89k/月 (Bullhorn Core / Crelate's 5-seat floor) at ~¥150/$. Cloud-itonami's flat, unlimited-seat model removes the per-seat penalty as an agency grows and is priced to undercut per-seat totals past ~4-5 staff, while the top of the band reflects the governed audit ledger + hard work-authorization/visa-consent check (入管法/I-9/right-to-work/AufenthG §4a) none of the 4 competitors enforce as an ungoverned block. This also lands in the same ¥50k-150k/月 range independently validated for the sibling flagships (isic-6399, isic-6310), giving the portfolio a consistent managed-tenant price point across all three." :rec/run-id "pricing-intel-20260716-03" :rec/at "2026-07-16" :rec/seq 130}
